<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <title><%= title %></title>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <%- include('partials/navigation') %>

    <main id="contenido-principal" class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center p-4 py-16">
        <div class="max-w-xl w-full bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
                <svg class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"></polyline>
                </svg>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3">
                Módulo de inscripción en preparación
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Has completado la navegación correspondiente al flujo demostrativo de selección de actividad comunitaria.
            </p>

            <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-left flex items-start gap-3 mb-8">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
                </svg>
                <div class="text-xs text-emerald-800">
                    <strong class="block font-bold">Garantía de gratuidad y privacidad</strong>
                    <span>Esta pantalla cumple propósitos demostrativos de diseño. Las actividades municipales de Talca son gratuitas y no requieren transacciones monetarias.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-left mb-8">
                <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
                    Etapas de la fase operativa:
                </h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-center">
                        <span class="inline-block w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold text-xs leading-6 mb-1">1</span>
                        <strong class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Selección</strong>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Reserva de cupo</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-center">
                        <span class="inline-block w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold text-xs leading-6 mb-1">2</span>
                        <strong class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Validación</strong>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Residencia Talca</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-center">
                        <span class="inline-block w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold text-xs leading-6 mb-1">3</span>
                        <strong class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Acceso</strong>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Ticket presencial</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-3">
                <a href="/event" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white shadow-sm transition">
                    Regresar al catálogo
                </a>
                <a href="/" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold bg-white text-slate-800 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 shadow-sm transition">
                    Ir al inicio
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>